Comments: semicolon-prefixed braces and brackets remove a balanced form inside code; dollar-semicolon disables a whole region.
$[Import* std]
${+ 1 ;{2} 3}
expect: 4
${+ 1 ;[don't count $ this, or "]" or {}] 2}
expect: 3
${{^ {x}
    ;{[# unused {error "never checked"}]}
    ;[Twice the input.]
    [# d {* 2 x}]
    d} 21}
expect: 42
${' ;{1} ;[2]}
expect: []
$;{+ 1 $missing} and $;[# disabled {error "x"}] produce nothing, even with active-looking text inside.
$[# {~ x} {* x 10}]
${~ 3}
expect: 30
${~{+ 1 2}}
expect: 30
A lone tilde before a space is ordinary: ~ {not a comment because prose is inert anyway}.
${++ ";{" "}"}
expect: ";{}"
